CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'xhci->hci_version < 0x100'
#3111: FILE: drivers/usb/host/xhci-ring.c:3134:
+	if ((xhci->quirks & XHCI_MTK_HOST) && (xhci->hci_version < 0x100))

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

